### 1. 创建新的监测任务（用于验证“定时任务 -> ReportService -> SMTP邮件”自动链路）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/task/create
Authorization: __CONFIGURE_LOCALLY__
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "keywords": ["人工智能", "AI"],
  "startTime": "2026-01-30T00:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-02-06T00:00:00",
  "interval": 1
}
